From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hendra Manudinata <manoedinata@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 09:08:56 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 051/105] mfd: add S2MPU06 core with interrupt support, power
 key, eMMC supplies

The PMIC's shared level-low interrupt is a regmap-irq chip on the PMIC
block; charger, fuel gauge and codec sources are acknowledged until their
drivers exist. Regulators become a cell of the new core, a power key
driver consumes the pwronf/pwronr interrupts, and mmc0 now gets its
vmmc/vqmmc from LDO14/LDO15.

Signed-off-by: Hendra Manudinata <manoedinata@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit ff0343fd184a45473465de4873c0a9296c4788ee)
